{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24365","headline":"池上早春即事招梦得 · 白居易","name":"池上早春即事招梦得","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"老更惊年改，闲先觉日长。\n晴熏榆荚黑，春染柳梢黄。\n云破山呈色，冰融水放光。\n低平稳船舫，轻暖好衣裳。\n白角三升榼，红茵六尺牀。\n偶游难得伴，独醉不成狂。\n我有中心乐，君无外事忙。\n经过莫慵嬾，相去两三坊。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24365.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24365","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}